## 1. Introduction

This document provides a detailed design for an AI-powered transaction monitoring system aimed at enhancing Anti-Money Laundering (AML) efforts within the financial services sector. The system leverages machine learning to identify suspicious transaction patterns that may indicate illicit financial activities, thereby improving detection accuracy and reducing false positives compared to traditional rule-based systems.

